<title>USA: US cash DAP, ammonia steady in modest trading.</title>
<headline>US cash DAP, ammonia steady in modest trading.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash DAP and ammonia prices were unchanged Wednesday in modest trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>However, some traders see DAP sales increasing sharply in the next three weeks as Midwestern producers begin to make</p>
<p>preparations for spring planting.</p>
<p>			  Dlrs/short ton	 Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	     177			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	 188			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	     220			unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
